                    1189.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "An activity that is permissible for the occupant of one position may very well not be permissible for the occupant of another position. Therefore, in considering each case on its individual merits, the employee must satisfy the following principles:",
